cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SUCCURRO, please cite it as below, and cite the upstream sources
  listed in each record's `sources:` entries (federal datasets, community
  feeds, and network directories are enumerated in docs/sources.md).
type: dataset
title: "SUCCURRO: a curated hyper-local dataset of US help and support services"
authors:
